  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 306.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 306.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to implement RSA 485-A:4, XVIII so as to reduce the discharge of mercury-containing amalgam from dental offices into wastewater.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Wq 306) #10346, eff 5-22-13; ss by #13287, eff 12-1-21",
